Noticing that the smile was fading from his wife’s face, Dr. Ettman decided to change the subject. “Layla, there’s a professor at Ratse University named Dr. Lorenz who’s an expert in avian biology. Make sure to sign up for a class with him when the school year starts. I think it could be quite beneficial for you to study under a great scholar like him.”
