Layla was taken aback by this sudden command.
“Bill Remmer is one of my favorite employees. You’re like a daughter to him, so I would like to give you a congratulatory gift,” Dowager Herhardt calmly said.
Out of surprise, Layla forgot her manners and stared straight at Dowager Herhardt. Meanwhile, two more people entered the greenhouse. “Duke Herhardt!” Claudine exclaimed with delight.
Everyone looked in the direction of Claudine’s gaze, including Layla.
Matthias von Herhardt was standing by the table. He made eye contact with Layla, whereupon they both frowned for different reasons. There was a slight feeling of tension in the room, until Layla removed it by averting her eyes.
