“Claudine is right, Matthias,” Elise von Herhardt remarked. “You shouldn’t overdo things when it comes to work, or it could have an impact on your health.”
The conversation at the tea table then turned to Matthias’s situation and the family business. In an instant, it was as if Layla was no longer there.
